#: org.kde.kuiviewer.metainfo.xml:9
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "KUIViewer"
msgstr "KUIViewer इति"

#: org.kde.kuiviewer.metainfo.xml:10
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "Qt Designer UI File Viewer"
msgstr "Qt डिजाइनर UI सञ्चिका दर्शक"

#: org.kde.kuiviewer.metainfo.xml:12
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"KUIViewer is a tool to display and check user interface (.ui) files created "
"in Qt Designer."
msgstr ""
"KUIViewer इति Qt Designer इत्यस्मिन् निर्मितानाम् उपयोक्तृ-अन्तरफलकस्य "
"(.ui) सञ्चिकानां प्रदर्शनाय, जाँचाय च एकं साधनम् अस्ति ।"